Test: Match Operators (~ and !~)
--------------------------------------
  'hello' ~ 'ell': 1
  'hello' ~ 'xyz': 0
  'test123' ~ '[0-9]+': 1
  'test123' ~ '^test': 1
  'test123' ~ '123$': 1

Negated Match (!~):
--------------------------------------
  'hello' !~ 'xyz': 1
  'hello' !~ 'ell': 0
  'abc' !~ '[0-9]+': 1
